{"availability":"available","full":"DuarteSantos8/openGym","name":"openGym","description":"Self-hosted gym & body-weight tracker — plan routines, log workouts (supersets, warm-ups, cardio), see which muscles are trained, fatigued or detrained, import from FitNotes/Strong/Hevy, passkey login. Your data, your server.","category":"Productivity","language":"JavaScript","stars":1736,"forks":415,"created":"2026-07-18T20:41:24Z","updated":"2026-09-28T14:04:29Z","license":"AGPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://opengym.duarte-santos.ch","topics":["bodyweight","docker","fitness","fitness-tracker","gym","health","mcp","nodejs","passkeys","progressive-web-applications","pwa","react","self-hosted","self-hosting","vite","webauthn","weightlifting","workout-tracker"],"demo":"https://opengym.duarte-santos.ch/demo/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:28.126Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:28.126Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:28.126Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:28.126Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T06:50:28.126Z","stars":1736,"forks":415}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A self-hosted gym & body-weight tracker you actually own.","Home — today's workout & weight Guided workout — animated demos & sets Stats — heatmap, charts & PRs","Most workout apps lock your data behind a login on their servers, nag you to upgrade, or disappear when the startup does. openGym is the opposite: it runs on your box, your data stays in a folder you control, and it's yours to fork. It still feels modern — installable as a home-screen app, passkey sign-in, offline support, sync across your phone and laptop."],"features":["⚖️ Body-weight tracking — interactive chart with a goal line you set, gains/losses colored by whether they move toward it","🏋️ Weekly plan — a routine per weekday, over a library of 1,324 exercises (searchable, with animated demos), browsable by muscle on a body map","✨ Four starter plans — Push/Pull/Legs, Upper/Lower, Full Body, 5×5; loaded as ordinary routines you can edit, and a routine can be copied in one tap","🗓️ Reschedule any day — sick, missed a session, or fewer gym days this week? Move a workout to another day without touching your weekly plan","📅 Your week starts where you say — Monday or Sunday, in Settings. The weekly plan, the day strip on Home, the calendar and every \"this week\" total follow it, so the app reads the way the calendar on your wall does"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DuarteSantos8/openGym/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d7dd558cacae89ed87c0416af82a147a4c8f51ee89f7293ed8cfd2cd7688acbc","extractedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:28.126Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T06:50:28.126Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A self-hosted gym & body-weight tracker you actually own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DuarteSantos8/openGym/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"A self-hosted gym & body-weight tracker you actually own.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DuarteSantos8/openGym/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Plan your week, run guided workouts, track every set and your body weight over time — on your phone, synced across devices, behind your own passkey login.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DuarteSantos8/openGym/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account on someone else's server, no subscription, no ads.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DuarteSantos8/openGym/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"A self-hosted instance can set its default language","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/DuarteSantos8/openGym/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The in-container AI runtimes live in a separate Docker build target; the API-key providers need none.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Du